        1,
        2,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winona%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits on the Western Vistas Historic Byway, a scenic route that traces the old trans‑continental highway.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.travelks.com/places-to-visit/cities/winona/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Winona High School once wore the Tigers mascot before school unification merged it into Triplains High School, whose teams now play as the Vikings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24,
        26,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
